    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4111" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">as-sŭo</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ads-</span></b> ), ĕre, v. a.,
